{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dearest Marie,\n\nThe evening light here is peculiar, catching the Rhine in a way that makes one forget the hours. I spent the day among the great two-masted vessels, their sails furled against the quiet water, and wandered through the churches. The stone here holds a weight that speaks of centuries, not just the present moment.\n\nI am to attend the cathedral mass tomorrow morning. The music, I am told, is worthy of the occasion. I shall be accompanied by the young Counts Stolberg and their tutor, Dean Kellermann. We must depart for Aachen this afternoon, so the day is already moving us forward.\n\nThink of me as I stand here, watching the river flow toward the sea. It is a fine, if tired, traveler’s view. Give my regards to the boys. I hope the snuff I purchased in Bonn suits your father.\n\nYours,\nG.W.F."}}],"created":1795080083,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":191,"prompt_tokens":938,"total_tokens":1129,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-34PxGFYMqOD3Vqiei0vHeql9Fr07W7CU","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":938,"prompt_ms":1073.095,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.1440245202558637,"prompt_per_second":874.1071386969467,"predicted_n":191,"predicted_ms":4514.705,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.761605263157893,"predicted_per_second":42.08469877876849}}